{"sourceUrl":"https://as.nju.edu.cn/a6/d3/c11322a763603/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:06.666049+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://as.nju.edu.cn/a6/d3/c11322a763603/page.htm","html":"<div><p></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span>为加强全国高校大气科学领域青年学子之间的交流，南京大学大气科学学院计划于</span><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月中下旬在南京大学仙林校区举办“全国大气科学优秀大学生开放日暨夏令营”活动，现面向全国招收大气科学学科以及相关学科的优秀本科生，即日起开放活动报名。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>一、招生</span></strong><strong><span>人数</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span>本次活动计划招</span><span>收</span><span>人数为</span><span>40</span><span>人</span><span>。</span></p><p><strong><span>二、时间和地点</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span><span>2025</span><span>年</span></span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>1</span><span>9</span><span><span>日</span><span>-</span></span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>21</span><span>日在南京大学仙林校区大气楼举行。</span></p><p><strong><span>三</span></strong><strong><span>、</span></strong><strong><span>报名</span></strong><strong><span>和</span></strong><strong><span>选拔</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span>（一）申请资格</span></p><p><span>学习成绩优秀并且</span><span>对大气科学</span><span>具有</span><span>浓厚兴趣</span><span>的</span><span>三年级本科生</span><span>，具有良好的英语听说读写能力。</span></p><p><span>（二）</span><span>报名方式</span></p><p><span><span>即日起至</span><span>2025</span><span>年</span></span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>11</span><span>日，有意向参加</span><span>活动</span><span>的同学，请完成报名流程</span><span>，</span><span><span>并实名申请加入活动</span><span>QQ</span><span>群：</span></span><span>993011989</span><span>。</span><span><span>6</span><span>月份已完成开放日报名的同学，不需要再重复报名。</span></span><span><span>联系人：李老师，联系电话：</span><span>025-896825</span></span><span>75</span><span>。</span></p><p><span><span>报名网址：</span><span>https://www.wjx.cn/vm/Ot6vSe2.aspx#</span><span>，请准确如实填写个人信息（请务必填全所有信息并上传附件，附件内容如下，请提前准备好。</span></span></p><p><span><span>1</span><span>、个人简介</span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span><span>、身份证正反面（排版在同一页）</span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span><span>、学生证封面和个人信息页</span></span></p><p><span><span>4</span><span>、本科阶段成绩单及排名证明（院系或教务处盖章）</span></span></p><p><span><span>5</span><span>、英语水平证明材料（四六级证书、托福、雅思、</span><span>GRE</span><span>等，须与个人填写的信息相匹配）</span></span></p><p><span><span>6</span><span>、荣誉获奖证明材料（如有多项，请选择</span><span>3</span><span>项代表性获奖证书，合成一个</span><span>pdf</span><span>）</span></span></p><p><span><span>7</span><span>、学术能力证明材料（如有多项，请选择</span><span>3</span><span>项代表性成果，合成一个</span><span>pdf</span><span>）</span></span></p><p><span>上述所有材料在报到时，提交纸质材料。</span></p><p><span>（三）</span><span>选拔</span></p><p><span>报名材料的审核和选拔将于</span><span>7</span><span><span>月</span><span>1</span></span><span>4</span><span>日前结束，参加</span><span>活动的</span><span><span>学生名单将在我院网站公布（</span><span>as</span></span><span>.nju.edu.cn</span><span>），不再另行通知。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>注意事项：</span></p><p><span><span>1</span><span>、本次活动</span></span><span>提供</span><span>用餐，</span><span>交通及住宿自理。</span></p><p><span><span>2</span><span>、</span></span><span>申请者应保证所提交材料信息的真实性、有效性、完整性，如因不实信息造成的后果完全由本人承担。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>南京大学大气科学学院</span></p><p><span>                   <span>2025</span><span>年</span></span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>4</span><span>日</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"de0c8142c08707f420e9e1257735094bd26d8e9c6904ebbeecbc9080378ccc02","textLength":772,"sourceSha256":"3e95ae0b9ada9913d6636eea3b17f69766c1239b925dccdc3d888a4a48e43947","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-fef66f56b538c082604c","title":"2025年南京大学大气科学学院2025年 “全国大气科学优秀大学生开放日暨夏令营活动”的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:06.666049+00:00"}
